WEBVTT

00:01.720 --> 00:04.616
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

00:04.685 --> 00:11.168
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:11.237 --> 00:14.823
Ooh, I love it when
me two best gals become
哦，我喜欢当
我成为两个最好的女孩

00:14.892 --> 00:17.099
me two best paying customers.
我是两个付费最高的客户。

00:17.168 --> 00:20.134
Sit tight.
Lunch is almost ready.
坐稳。
午餐快准备好了。

00:20.203 --> 00:22.858
Order up!
赶快下单吧！

00:22.927 --> 00:25.547
- Uh...
- Oh!
- 呃...
- 哦！

00:25.616 --> 00:28.616
Let me get a southwestern patty,
给我一份西南馅饼

00:28.685 --> 00:29.961
heavy on the south.
南方重。

00:30.030 --> 00:32.547
- No, wait!
- Uh...
- 不，等等！
- 呃...

00:32.616 --> 00:33.616
[laughs]
[笑]

00:33.651 --> 00:35.099
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

00:35.168 --> 00:37.168
Ooh, feels like Mrs. Puff!
哦哦，感觉像泡芙夫人！

00:37.237 --> 00:38.927
Hi, Mrs. Puff.
嗨，普芙女士。

00:38.996 --> 00:40.547
[laughs]
[笑]

00:40.616 --> 00:41.547
Ugh.
啊。

00:41.616 --> 00:43.823
Remember, SpongeBob, we agreed:
请记住，海绵宝宝，我们同意：

00:43.892 --> 00:46.961
outside of class,
we don't know each other.
课外，
我们互相不认识。

00:47.030 --> 00:48.341
Oh, yeah!
哦，是啊！

00:48.409 --> 00:52.651
Well, here's your Krabby Patty,
mysterious lady.
好吧，这是你的蟹肉饼，
神秘的女士。

00:52.720 --> 00:55.685
[popping]
[爆裂声]

00:55.754 --> 00:58.375
[squirts, pops]
[喷射，流行音乐]

00:58.444 --> 01:00.547
"Eye" hope you enjoy your meal.
“眼睛”希望您用餐愉快。

01:00.616 --> 01:01.720
[laughs]
[笑]

01:01.789 --> 01:03.858
<i>[ominous music]</i>
<i>[不祥的音乐]</i>

01:03.927 --> 01:06.341
[gasps]
The health inspector?
[喘气]
卫生督察？

01:06.409 --> 01:08.720
But I already bribed him
this year.
但我已经贿赂了他
今年。

01:08.789 --> 01:09.961
[device beeps]
- Mm-hmm.
[设备蜂鸣声]
- 嗯嗯。

01:10.030 --> 01:11.547
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

01:11.616 --> 01:13.375
Just as I feared.
正如我所担心的那样。

01:13.444 --> 01:16.478
Someone in this restaurant is infected
这家餐厅有人被感染

01:16.547 --> 01:20.927
with the highly contagious
clam flu.
具有高度传染性
蛤流感。

01:20.996 --> 01:24.168
You're all under quarantine.
你们都在隔离中。

01:24.237 --> 01:25.651
[device pings]
[设备 ping]

01:25.720 --> 01:28.996
Hmm.
Hmm.
唔。
唔。

01:29.065 --> 01:31.065
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

01:31.134 --> 01:34.754
- [grunting]
- Ahh!
- [咕哝]
- 啊！

01:34.823 --> 01:36.685
[yelling]
Oh!
[大喊]
哦！

01:36.754 --> 01:37.651
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:37.720 --> 01:38.892
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

01:38.961 --> 01:41.961
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

01:42.030 --> 01:44.547
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

01:44.616 --> 01:47.168
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:47.237 --> 01:50.685
Wait.
What's a "corn-a-bean"?
等待。
What's a "corn-a-bean"?

01:50.754 --> 01:53.823
A quarantine is like
a mandatory sleepover,
隔离就像
强制性过夜，

01:53.892 --> 01:55.375
and we're all invited.
我们都被邀请了。

01:55.444 --> 01:57.237
both: Sleepover!
Sleepover!
两人：过夜！
过夜！

01:57.306 --> 01:58.892
[air horn blares]
[both shriek]
[air horn blares]
[两人都尖叫]

01:58.961 --> 02:01.030
A quarantine means
you're locked in here
检疫手段
你被锁在这里了

02:01.099 --> 02:04.582
with a sick person until
we're all sick and miserable.
with a sick person until
我们都生病了，都很痛苦。

02:04.651 --> 02:07.685
[gasping]
[喘气]

02:07.754 --> 02:08.961
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:09.030 --> 02:12.030
Well, I'm aborting
Operation Soda Jerk.
嗯，我要放弃了
苏打混蛋行动。

02:12.099 --> 02:15.030
Communicable diseases are
my cue to leave.
传染性疾病是
my cue to leave.

02:15.099 --> 02:19.168
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:19.237 --> 02:20.720
[laughs]
[笑]

02:20.789 --> 02:22.720
Quarantine, shmorantine.
检疫，shmorantine。

02:22.789 --> 02:26.099
I'm the great... ahh!
我是伟大的……啊！

02:26.168 --> 02:28.237
Breach contained!
违规已被遏制！

02:28.306 --> 02:29.789
Good work.
干得好。

02:29.858 --> 02:31.858
[moaning]
[呻吟]

02:31.927 --> 02:34.754
[gulps]
Maybe we should stay inside.
[吞咽]
也许我们应该呆在里面。

02:34.823 --> 02:38.892
But I have to cheer
at the big game tomorrow.
但我必须欢呼
在明天的大型比赛中。

02:38.961 --> 02:43.375
Everyone's gonna laugh at me
if I get sick and die first.
每个人都会笑我
如果我先生病死了。

02:43.444 --> 02:46.651
Oh, not to worry,
me massive, little angel.
哦，不用担心，
me massive, little angel.

02:46.720 --> 02:49.272
We'll just do what we did
in me old navy days.
我们就做我们做过的事
在我过去的海军时代。

02:49.341 --> 02:51.341
Ooh, old navy days.
哦，旧海军时代。

02:51.409 --> 02:53.961
You see, first,
we found the sicko,
你看，首先，
我们找到了病人，

02:54.030 --> 02:56.134
and then we just locked 'em
in the freezer-o.
然后我们就把它们锁起来
in the freezer-o.

02:56.203 --> 02:58.375
With the infected sailor isolated,
随着被感染的水手被隔离，

02:58.444 --> 03:00.513
the rest of us could
enjoy ourselves,
我们其他人可以
享受我们自己，

03:00.582 --> 03:02.547
certain of our continued
good health.
确定我们继续
身体健康。

03:02.616 --> 03:05.065
[sighs]
Good times.
[叹气]
美好时光。

03:05.134 --> 03:07.478
You let them out of the freezer
你把它们从冰箱里拿出来

03:07.547 --> 03:09.547
once they were better, right?
一旦他们变得更好，对吧？

03:09.616 --> 03:10.892
Huh?
啊？

03:10.961 --> 03:13.858
I suppose someone
let 'em out... eventually.
I suppose someone
让他们出去……最终。

03:13.927 --> 03:15.065
Okay.
[laughs]
好的。
[笑]

03:15.134 --> 03:16.409
Who's feeling queasy?
谁感觉不舒服？

03:16.478 --> 03:17.685
Go ahead now, raise your hand.
现在继续，举起你的手。

03:17.754 --> 03:18.961
[crickets chirp]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

03:19.030 --> 03:21.961
So that's how
you wanna play it, eh?
所以就是这样
你想玩吗？

03:22.030 --> 03:23.134
Fine.
美好的。

03:23.203 --> 03:24.892
I'll examine all of ya for signs
我会检查你们所有人是否有迹象

03:24.961 --> 03:26.582
of the pestilence meself!
瘟疫本身！

03:26.651 --> 03:27.478
Oh, no!
哦，不！

03:27.547 --> 03:29.375
I am not letting any of you
我不会让你们任何人

03:29.444 --> 03:31.685
infected imbeciles near me.
我附近被感染的低能儿。

03:31.754 --> 03:32.927
I'm... oh!
我是……哦！

03:32.996 --> 03:35.065
[grunts, sniffs]
[咕哝声，嗅嗅]

03:35.134 --> 03:37.651
[sneezes]
[all whimper]
[打喷嚏]
[全都呜咽]

03:37.720 --> 03:40.272
He's the sick one.
He belongs in the freezer!
He's the sick one.
他属于冰箱里！

03:40.341 --> 03:42.237
Get him!
- Ah!
抓住他！
- 啊！

03:42.306 --> 03:43.409
Wait!
等待！

03:43.478 --> 03:45.065
I'll go willingly.
- [grunts]
I'll go willingly.
- [咕哝]

03:45.134 --> 03:46.444
I feel fine,
我感觉很好，

03:46.513 --> 03:50.168
but I don't wanna risk
infecting my friends.
但我不想冒险
感染我的朋友。

03:50.237 --> 03:51.651
Hmm?
唔？

03:51.720 --> 03:54.927
Especially you, Squidward.
[smooches]
Especially you, Squidward.
[亲吻]

03:54.996 --> 03:57.823
[yells, panting]
[大喊，气喘吁吁]

03:57.892 --> 03:59.789
<i>[somber music]</i>
<i>[忧郁的音乐]</i>

03:59.858 --> 04:03.685
All I ask is that
you remember me as I was,
我所要问的是
你还记得我本来的样子

04:03.754 --> 04:05.203
full of life...
充满生机……

04:05.272 --> 04:06.996
Whew. <i>- No!</i>
呼。 <i>- 不！</i>

04:07.065 --> 04:11.341
Oh, it sounds like
he's really suffering in there.
哦，听起来像
他在那里真的很痛苦。

04:11.409 --> 04:14.720
Oh!
I can't bear to look.
哦！
我不忍心看。

04:14.789 --> 04:17.134
Can someone describe it to me?
有人可以向我描述一下吗？

04:17.203 --> 04:19.513
All right, come on now.
Come on.
好吧，现在就来吧。
快点。

04:19.582 --> 04:22.375
Let the poor boy enjoy
his agony in peace.
让这个可怜的孩子享受
他的痛苦平静。

04:22.444 --> 04:24.099
<i>Whoo!</i>
<i>哇！</i>

04:24.168 --> 04:26.996
[laughing]
[笑]

04:27.065 --> 04:28.927
Yow!
Oh!
哟！
哦！

04:28.996 --> 04:30.409
[laughs]
[笑]

04:30.478 --> 04:32.203
Yeah!
Whee!
是的！
哎哟！

04:32.272 --> 04:33.513
Whoo!
呼！

04:33.582 --> 04:35.409
Ooh, ice cream.
哦，冰淇淋。

04:35.478 --> 04:37.858
Well, problem solved.
嗯，问题解决了。

04:37.927 --> 04:40.789
Now we sit back and wait
for the all clear.
现在我们坐下来等待
为了一切都清楚。

04:40.858 --> 04:42.616
Hmm?
唔？

04:42.685 --> 04:44.168
Hey.
嘿。

04:44.237 --> 04:46.409
[licking]
[舔]

04:46.478 --> 04:49.306
Oh.
Ooh.
哦。
哦。

04:49.375 --> 04:50.927
[all sigh]
[Patrick laughs]
[众人叹息]
[帕特里克笑]

04:50.996 --> 04:55.685
Boy, I sure am feeling
under the leather.
男孩，我确实感觉
在皮革下面。

04:55.754 --> 04:59.134
It's "weather," you moron,
and... ah!
这是“天气”，你这个白痴，
还有……啊！

04:59.203 --> 05:00.892
Sweet Neptune!
甜蜜的海王星！

05:00.961 --> 05:02.720
[moaning]
[呻吟]

05:02.789 --> 05:05.375
The clam flu, it's spreading!
蛤流感，正在蔓延！

05:05.444 --> 05:07.961
Into the freezer with him!
和他一起进冰箱！

05:08.030 --> 05:09.547
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:09.616 --> 05:11.961
Huh?
Hmm.
啊？
唔。

05:12.030 --> 05:15.065
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

05:15.134 --> 05:17.099
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

05:17.168 --> 05:18.272
[squeals]
[尖叫声]

05:18.341 --> 05:19.582
[sighs]
[叹气]

05:19.651 --> 05:21.582
We'll just have to be
more vigilant now.
我们只需要做
现在更加警惕了。

05:21.651 --> 05:24.168
Anyone could be a carrier.
任何人都可以成为携带者。

05:24.237 --> 05:25.478
[hums]
[哼哼]

05:25.547 --> 05:28.651
Itchy skin!
He's got clam flu!
皮肤痒！
他得了蛤流感！

05:28.720 --> 05:30.478
What?
No, no, I was just scratching.
什么？
不不不，我只是在抓挠而已。

05:30.547 --> 05:32.237
Freezer!
冰箱！

05:32.306 --> 05:34.547
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:36.030 --> 05:38.478
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:38.547 --> 05:40.996
[huffing]
[气喘吁吁]

05:41.065 --> 05:42.168
[sighs]
[叹气]

05:42.237 --> 05:43.513
[yawns]
[哈欠]

05:43.582 --> 05:45.789
Freezer!
冰箱！

05:45.858 --> 05:47.961
[yelling]
[大喊]

05:48.030 --> 05:50.203
Heh, at least we know
we're safe now,
呵呵，至少我们知道
我们现在安全了

05:50.272 --> 05:51.996
me baby beluga.
我的白鲸宝宝。

05:52.065 --> 05:53.065
[strained laugh]
[紧张的笑声]

05:53.099 --> 05:55.409
Oh, I just remembered.
哦，我刚刚想起来了。

05:55.478 --> 05:58.065
I didn't spend all your money
at the mall.
我没有花你所有的钱
在商场。

05:58.134 --> 05:59.720
Here's your change.
这是你的零钱。

05:59.789 --> 06:01.478
Change?
改变？

06:01.547 --> 06:04.444
Oh, the disease must have addled
哦，这病一定是疯了

06:04.513 --> 06:08.134
your tiny teenage mind!
你那幼小的心灵！

06:08.203 --> 06:10.030
Wait!
I take it back.
等待！
我收回它。

06:10.099 --> 06:12.341
There's still some shoes
I wanna buy!
还有一些鞋子
我想买！

06:12.409 --> 06:13.444
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:13.513 --> 06:15.203
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

06:15.272 --> 06:18.272
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

06:18.341 --> 06:20.134
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:20.203 --> 06:21.444
<i>[cheerful music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

06:21.513 --> 06:22.927
<i>♪ La, la, la, la, la, la ♪</i>
<i>♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦♪</i>

06:22.996 --> 06:24.651
<i>♪ La, la, la, la, la ♪</i>
<i>♪ 啦，啦，啦，啦，啦 ♪</i>

06:24.720 --> 06:25.720
<i>♪ La, la, la, la ♪</i>
<i>♪ 啦，啦，啦，啦 ♪</i>

06:25.754 --> 06:28.065
<i>So let me get this straight.</i>
<i>所以让我说清楚。</i>

06:28.134 --> 06:31.651
Nobody in this freezer is
actually sick?
这个冰箱里没有人
真的生病了吗？

06:31.720 --> 06:33.547
- Never felt better.
- I'm fine.
- 从未感觉好过。
- 我很好。

06:33.616 --> 06:35.375
Ice cream!
冰淇淋！

06:35.444 --> 06:37.582
Well, if no one's sick in here,
好吧 如果这里没有人生病的话

06:37.651 --> 06:40.237
then the sick person must be...
那么这个病人一定是……

06:40.306 --> 06:41.927
[gasps]
Daddy!
[喘气]
爸爸！

06:41.996 --> 06:44.823
Oh, no!
- There, there.
哦，不！
- 那里，那里。

06:44.892 --> 06:46.513
Oh, ah, oh!
哦，啊，哦！

06:46.582 --> 06:49.341
I say we bust out of here,
grab Krabs,
我说我们离开这里
抢螃蟹，

06:49.409 --> 06:51.272
and lock him away.
并把他锁起来。

06:51.341 --> 06:53.237
Oh, yeah!- Daddy!
哦，是的！-爸爸！

06:53.306 --> 06:54.651
Who's this now?
现在这个人是谁？

06:54.720 --> 06:55.996
I don't know.
我不知道。

06:56.065 --> 06:58.030
Mr. Krabs didn't tell us
to question his orders.
蟹老板没有告诉我们
质疑他的命令。

06:58.099 --> 07:00.547
I'll just wait for him
to let me out.
我只会等他
让我出去。

07:00.616 --> 07:02.961
You can't cook Krabby Patties
你不会煮蟹肉饼

07:03.030 --> 07:05.444
if you're locked in the freezer.
如果你被锁在冰箱里。

07:06.823 --> 07:11.513
All right, let's put
this crab on ice.
好吧，让我们把
这只螃蟹在冰上。

07:11.582 --> 07:14.513
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

07:14.582 --> 07:16.237
[screams]
[尖叫声]

07:16.306 --> 07:19.030
You sickos are supposed to be
in the freezer!
你们这些病应该是
在冰箱里！

07:19.099 --> 07:20.375
You're the sicko!
你就是那个病人！

07:20.444 --> 07:22.478
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:22.547 --> 07:23.651
[objects clang]
[物体叮当作响]

07:23.720 --> 07:26.134
Stay away from me, you sickos!
离我远点，你们这些变态！

07:26.203 --> 07:27.754
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

07:27.823 --> 07:29.341
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:29.409 --> 07:31.237
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:31.306 --> 07:32.513
For the good of all of us,
为了我们大家的利益，

07:32.582 --> 07:34.685
you have to go into the freezer.
你必须进入冰箱。

07:34.754 --> 07:37.099
Keep your filthy hands off me,
把你的脏手拿开我

07:37.168 --> 07:38.478
you infected ingrate.
你感染了忘恩负义。

07:38.547 --> 07:41.823
Oh, look.
Freedom!
哦，看。
自由！

07:41.892 --> 07:43.099
[laughs]
[笑]

07:43.168 --> 07:46.237
[grunts]
He's in the grease trap!
[咕哝]
他掉进了油脂陷阱里了！

07:46.306 --> 07:48.030
Well, someone's gonna have
to fish him out
嗯，有人会有
把他捞出来

07:48.099 --> 07:50.720
before he gets to the sewer
and infects the whole town!
在他到达下水道之前
并感染了整个城镇！

07:50.789 --> 07:52.478
Hey, I can help!
嘿，我可以帮忙！

07:53.547 --> 07:56.858
[grunts]
- [gasps]
[咕哝]
- [喘气]

07:56.927 --> 07:59.341
[coughing]
- [grunting]
[咳嗽]
- [咕哝]

07:59.409 --> 08:00.685
- Patrick. Patrick!
- Huh?
- 帕特里克.帕特里克！
- 啊？

08:00.754 --> 08:03.065
There's full sized hatch
over here.
有全尺寸舱口
在这里。

08:03.134 --> 08:04.858
Well, what do you know?
那么，你知道什么？

08:04.927 --> 08:06.444
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

08:06.513 --> 08:08.547
[gasps, coughs]
[喘气、咳嗽]

08:08.616 --> 08:11.547
Eugene, are you in here?
尤金，你在这儿吗？

08:11.616 --> 08:13.065
[gurgles]
[咯咯声]

08:13.134 --> 08:15.444
[yells, coughs]
[喊叫、咳嗽]

08:15.513 --> 08:19.134
Ah!
Sicko germs!
啊!
病菌！

08:19.203 --> 08:21.134
[coughs]
Ah!
[咳嗽]
啊！

08:21.203 --> 08:22.996
You can't catch me.
你抓不到我。

08:23.065 --> 08:26.099
I'm too healthy
for all you sickos!
我太健康了
为了你们所有的病态！

08:26.168 --> 08:27.272
[laughs]
[笑]

08:27.341 --> 08:29.099
Daddy, stop!
爸爸，停下来！

08:29.168 --> 08:30.961
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

08:31.030 --> 08:32.858
[snorts]
[哼哼]

08:32.927 --> 08:34.547
[spits]
[吐口水]

08:34.616 --> 08:35.858
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:37.616 --> 08:39.789
There's nowhere left to run.
无处可逃。

08:39.858 --> 08:42.065
I'm not licked yet!
我还没被舔呢！

08:42.134 --> 08:43.858
Oh, yeah?
哦，是吗？

08:43.927 --> 08:46.168
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:46.237 --> 08:47.582
[growls]
[咆哮]

08:47.651 --> 08:50.341
[grunts]
- [yelps]
[咕哝]
- [尖叫声]

08:50.409 --> 08:52.203
Hey.
Hey!
嘿。
嘿！

08:52.272 --> 08:53.409
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

08:53.478 --> 08:55.478
You'll never get me.
Ha-ha!
你永远得不到我。
哈哈！

08:55.547 --> 08:58.858
[grunts, coughs]
[咕哝声、咳嗽声]

09:00.065 --> 09:01.444
[yells]
[喊叫]

09:01.513 --> 09:02.892
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

09:02.961 --> 09:06.065
[yelling]
- [moaning]
[大喊]
- [呻吟]

09:06.134 --> 09:07.168
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:07.237 --> 09:08.341
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

09:08.409 --> 09:10.444
<i>[quirky music]</i>
<i>[古怪的音乐]</i>

09:10.513 --> 09:13.134
[yelping]
[尖叫]

09:13.203 --> 09:14.582
Ah!
啊!

09:15.685 --> 09:17.409
I got him!
I got him!
我抓到他了！
我抓到他了！

09:17.478 --> 09:20.478
[yells, grunts]
[喊叫，咕哝]

09:20.547 --> 09:22.444
Ah!
Oh!
啊!
哦！

09:22.513 --> 09:25.341
[all clamoring,
objects crashing]
[大家都在叫嚣，
物体崩溃]

09:29.134 --> 09:33.168
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

09:33.237 --> 09:34.823
[hums]
[哼哼]

09:34.892 --> 09:37.547
Hmm, hello?
Anyone here?
嗯，你好？
这里有人吗？

09:37.616 --> 09:39.030
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

09:39.099 --> 09:40.547
Ha, funny story,
哈，有趣的故事，

09:40.616 --> 09:45.409
um, I was holding my equipment
upside down yesterday.
嗯，我拿着我的装备
昨天颠倒了。

09:45.478 --> 09:48.237
[laughs]
Nobody was actually sick.
[笑]
实际上没有人生病。

09:48.306 --> 09:49.961
Ha!
Oh, what a goof.
哈!
哦，真是个傻瓜。

09:50.030 --> 09:53.513
Huh?
[all groaning]
啊？
[全都呻吟]

09:53.582 --> 09:55.927
Oh, my Neptune.
哦，我的海王星。

09:56.823 --> 09:57.961
Grease gout.
油脂痛风。

09:58.030 --> 10:01.858
- [moans]
- Moldy measles!
- [呻吟]
- 发霉的麻疹！

10:01.927 --> 10:04.203
<i>[suspenseful music]</i>
<i>[悬疑音乐]</i>

10:04.272 --> 10:06.444
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:06.513 --> 10:08.823
Trash trichinosis!
垃圾旋毛虫病！

10:08.892 --> 10:11.513
[moans, coughing]
[呻吟、咳嗽]

10:11.582 --> 10:13.547
Dust bunny bronchitis!
尘兔支气管炎！

10:13.616 --> 10:16.478
[gasps, sneezes]
[喘气，打喷嚏]

10:16.547 --> 10:19.754
Polyester plague!
涤纶瘟疫！

10:21.030 --> 10:22.341
[gasps]
[喘气]

10:22.409 --> 10:25.375
[retches, groans]
[干呕、呻吟]

10:25.444 --> 10:28.168
The whole shebang!
整个shebang！

10:28.237 --> 10:30.685
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

10:30.754 --> 10:32.341
They're all sick!
他们都病了！

10:32.409 --> 10:35.168
Ultra-mega quarantine!
超大规模隔离！

10:35.237 --> 10:36.513
You heard him.
你听到他的声音了。

10:36.582 --> 10:40.375
Get this disease-ridden
cesspit out of here!
得了这个病
粪坑离开这里！

10:40.444 --> 10:42.720
Drop it somewhere safe,
把它扔到安全的地方，

10:42.789 --> 10:46.306
somewhere no one ever goes...
没有人去过的地方...

10:46.375 --> 10:47.582
<i>[all moaning]</i>
<i>[全都呻吟]</i>

10:47.651 --> 10:48.961
<i>What the...?</i>
<i>什么...？</i>

10:49.030 --> 10:50.030
<i>No!</i>
<i>不！</i>

10:50.065 --> 10:51.651
<i>I don't wanna get sick too.</i>
<i>我也不想生病。</i>

10:51.720 --> 10:53.547
<i>Stay away! No!</i>
<i>走开！不！</i>

10:53.616 --> 10:55.444
<i>[sneezes]</i>
<i>[打喷嚏]</i>

10:55.513 --> 10:58.658
<i>Ah, barnacles.</i>
<i>啊，藤壶。</i>

<i>啊，藤壶。</i>